### LEGAL & EDUCATIONAL DISCLAIMER (ข้อสงวนสิทธิ์ทางกฎหมาย)

This project is developed solely for educational, academic, and non-monetary recreational purposes to demonstrate full-stack web application development and real-time state synchronization.

1. **No Real Money / No Gambling**: This application does NOT facilitate or support real-money wagering, betting, payouts, deposits, or transactions of any valuable assets. All chips simulated within this software are purely virtual numerical counters (digital ledger) intended for home games with physical cards.
2. **Compliance with Laws**: The author explicitly condemns illegal gambling activities. Users are responsible for complying with all applicable local, national, and international laws.
3. **Limitation of Liability**: Under no circumstances shall the author be held liable for any misuse of this software in violation of local gambling statutes or any unlawful activities conducted by third parties.
